id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-03-05T19:34:04Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T11:34:36Z","closed_at":"2025-03-24T00:09:11Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103647","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103647","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103647.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103647.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-24T00:09:10Z"},"body":"Updated `Dictionary::operator[]` to get reference to value once to avoid multiple `HashMap` lookups.\r\n\r\nMakes creating new dictionaries, merging, and duplicating dictionaries from gdscript around 5-10% faster, along with some improvements to functions that return dictionaries.\r\n\r\nTested with gdscript below:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\trun_test(\"new_dictionary\")\r\n\trun_test(\"merge_dictionary\")\r\n\trun_test(\"duplicate_dictionary\")\r\n\trun_test(\"method_list\")\r\n\r\nfunc new_dictionary():\r\n\tfor i in 1000000:\r\n\t\t{1: 1, \"key\": \"value\"}\r\n\r\nfunc merge_dictionary():\r\n\tvar d1 := { 1: 1, 3: 3, 5: 5, 7: 7, 9: 9 }\r\n\tvar d2 := { 0: 0, 2: 2, 4: 4, 6: 6, 8: 8 }\r\n\tfor i in 100000:\r\n\t\tvar d3 := d1.merged(d2)\r\n\r\nfunc duplicate_dictionary():\r\n\tvar d := {\r\n\t\t1: 1,\r\n\t\t\"key\": \"value\",\r\n\t\t\"array\": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\r\n\t}\r\n\tfor i in 1000000:\r\n\t\td.duplicate()\r\n\r\nfunc method_list():\r\n\tfor i in 100:\r\n\t\tget_method_list()\r\n\r\nfunc run_test(p_func_name : String):\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tcall(p_func_name)\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"%s: %dms\" % [p_func_name, end - start])\r\n```\r\n\r\nold:\r\n```\r\nnew_dictionary: 575ms\r\nmerge_dictionary: 181ms\r\nduplicate_dictionary: 848ms\r\nmethod_list: 365ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nnew:\r\n```\r\nnew_dictionary: 548ms\r\nmerge_dictionary: 165ms\r\nduplicate_dictionary: 788ms\r\nmethod_list: 334ms\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103647/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":7,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103647/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}